---
// Hand-drawn sketch for the "way of thinking" sheet on the home page: logic
// tangled inside a component versus logic in a store under a thin UI skin.
---

<figure class="sketch">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 480 250"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Logic in components: a tangle of effects inside the component. Or logic in stores: the store holds data, loading and rules, the component only renders. UI as a skin."
  >
    <g
      class="ink-lines"
      fill="none"
      stroke-linecap="round"
      stroke-linejoin="round"
    >
      <!-- before: a component box with tangled logic -->
      <text class="hand small muted" x="94" y="24" text-anchor="middle">
        logic in components
      </text>
      <path d="M16 42 C58 37 118 39 170 41" />
      <path d="M168 38 C171 88 167 142 170 192" />
      <path d="M172 190 C118 194 62 193 18 189" />
      <path d="M20 193 C16 140 19 90 15 40" />
      <path
        class="tangle"
        d="M44 118 c14 -38 58 22 76 -14 s-58 -34 -48 16 s72 14 62 -28 s-52 38 -30 52 s40 -40 8 -46 s-60 30 -40 44 s50 -6 44 -30"
      />
      <text class="hand small" x="28" y="68" transform="rotate(-6 28 68)">
        useEffect
      </text>
      <text class="hand small" x="108" y="76" transform="rotate(5 108 76)">
        fetch()
      </text>
      <text class="hand small" x="96" y="176" transform="rotate(-3 96 176)">
        deps [ ]
      </text>
      <text class="hand" x="54" y="218">
        component
      </text>

      <!-- The second system stands apart, with open space between the diagrams. -->
      <text class="hand small muted" x="245" y="24" text-anchor="middle">
        or
      </text>
      <g transform="translate(60 0)">
        <text class="hand small muted" x="336" y="24" text-anchor="middle">
          logic in stores
        </text>
        <path class="store store-mark" d="M264 42 C312 39 362 41 408 43" />
        <path class="store store-mark" d="M407 41 C409 62 406 84 408 104" />
        <path class="store store-mark" d="M409 103 C360 106 312 105 263 103" />
        <path class="store store-mark" d="M265 105 C262 84 266 62 262 41" />
        <text class="hand store-mark" x="336" y="70" text-anchor="middle">
          store
        </text>
        <text class="hand small" x="336" y="92" text-anchor="middle">
          data · loading · rules
        </text>

        <path d="M334 110 C335 120 333 130 334 140" />
        <path d="M327 132 L334 142 L341 133" />
        <text class="hand small muted" x="344" y="130">
          renders
        </text>

        <path class="skin" d="M264 146 C310 143 362 145 408 147" />
        <path class="skin" d="M407 145 C409 164 406 184 408 202" />
        <path class="skin" d="M409 201 C360 204 312 203 263 201" />
        <path class="skin" d="M265 203 C262 184 266 164 262 145" />
        <text class="hand" x="336" y="180" text-anchor="middle">
          components
        </text>

        <!-- caption -->
        <text class="hand" x="276" y="238">
          UI as a skin
        </text>
        <path d="M274 244 C300 240 340 246 372 241" />
      </g>
    </g>
  </svg>
</figure>
<style>
  /* The sketch */
  .sketch {
    margin: var(--space-2) 0 var(--space-6);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .sketch svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 560px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .ink-lines {
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 2.2;
  }
  .tangle {
    stroke-width: 1.8;
  }
  .skin {
    stroke-width: 1.6;
    stroke-dasharray: 6 5;
  }
  .store {
    stroke-width: 2.6;
  }
  .hand {
    fill: currentColor;
    stroke: none;
    font-family: 'Shantell Sans', 'Comic Sans MS', cursive;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .hand.small {
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .hand.muted {
    fill: var(--text-3);
  }
</style>
